@startuml F5.17-D01-solicitar-exportacao
title F5.17-D01 — Solicitar exportação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ExportController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateExportUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Solicitar exportação
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /exportacoes/{kind}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: INSERT export_job\nPROCESSANDO
note right of UC
  sem gerar arquivo aqui
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> Ctrl: job
Ctrl --> WebApp: 202
WebApp --> Sec: histórico PROCESSANDO

@enduml
